<title>POLAND: NFI Fortuna nets PLN 24.2 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI Fortuna nets PLN 24.2 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Fortuna (No. 13) preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997	    H1 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			 24.17		24.80 loss</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  448.04	     428.86</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions   19.30		 7.16</p>
<p>  Net assets			493.51	     423.22</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 15.91		12.09</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny Fortuna SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
